  "artifact": ".rpiv/artifacts/plans/2026-07-27_17-12-43_runner-cleanup-nodes-snippets-modal-ux.md",
  "findings": [
    {
      "detail": "Phase 2's build/test claim is false with only the five named test suites updated: tsconfig.json includes every src/**/*.ts file, while omitted suites still import JsonSnippet or construct kind: 'json', including src/__tests__/views/snippet-chip-editor.test.ts:265, src/__tests__/views/snippet-fill-in-modal.test.ts:251, src/__tests__/views/snippet-editor-modal-banner.test.ts:267, src/__tests__/views/snippet-editor-modal-folder-picker.test.ts:267, src/__tests__/views/snippet-tree-picker.test.ts:246, src/__tests__/snippet-tree-view.test.ts:241, src/__tests__/snippet-tree-dnd.test.ts:283, src/__tests__/snippet-tree-inline-rename.test.ts:232, and src/__tests__/views/inline-runner-modal.test.ts:76.",
      "where": "## Phase 2: Remove JSON snippet code support and rewrite README"
    },
    {
      "detail": "The claim that JSON snippets become absent from listing is false for picker search: SnippetService.listFolderDescendants pushes every file without extension filtering at src/snippets/snippet-service.ts:327, and SnippetTreePicker renders every matching descendant file at src/views/snippet-tree-picker.ts:491-515, so legacy .json files remain visible and selectable during search.",
      "where": "## Phase 2: Remove JSON snippet code support and rewrite README"
    },
    {
      "detail": "The c2-r2 safety premise is false: renameSnippet is a public path-based operation, current direct coverage passes .json sources at src/__tests__/snippet-service-move.test.ts:159-169, and manager rename callers pass row paths directly. Forcing the destination extension to .md can rename legacy JSON bytes as Markdown rather than making those sources unreachable.",
      "where": "## Risk Flags — c2-r2"
    },
    {
      "detail": "Phase 3 contradicts the goal's explicit requirement, \"I want to remove the “Text block” node type and have the “Answer” node perform the same function.\" Although chained Answer nodes already auto-append and pass through at src/runner/protocol-runner.ts:736-762, the plan retains text-block in the graph model, parser, editor, picker, and runner instead of removing it.",
      "where": "## Phase 3: Remove 'text-block' from creation surfaces while retaining runtime support"
    },
    {
      "detail": "The c2-r1 claim that silent removal is acceptable is unresolved and conflicts with repository execution coverage: src/__tests__/views/inline-runner-modal.test.ts:101-196 exercises JSON loading/fill paths, while the plan supplies neither migration nor notice and intentionally sends existing references to not-found.",
      "where": "## Risk Flags — c2-r1"
    },
    {
      "detail": "The short-viewport claim does not follow from the proposed CSS: max-height on .rp-insert-snippet-modal does not make the fixed 480px body or fixed 440px result list shrink, and the plan adds no responsive child-height override or explicit modal overflow rule.",
      "where": "## Risk Flags — c5-r1"
    },
    {
      "detail": "The no-content-shift claim is false against the current row box model: rows use border: 1px solid transparent and box-sizing: border-box at src/styles/snippet-tree-picker.css:153-170, while the plan changes only the highlighted left border to 2px, moving the content edge inward by 1px.",
      "where": "## Risk Flags — c5-r2"
    }
  ],
  "risk_rulings": [
    { "id": "c1-r1", "pass": true },
    { "id": "c2-r1", "pass": false },
    { "id": "c2-r2", "pass": false },
    { "id": "c2-r3", "pass": true },
    { "id": "c3-r1", "pass": false },
    { "id": "c4-r1", "pass": true },
    { "id": "c4-r2", "pass": true },
    { "id": "c5-r1", "pass": false },
    { "id": "c5-r2", "pass": false }
  ],
  "finding_rulings": [
    {
      "where": "## Phase 2: Remove JSON snippet code support and rewrite README",
      "ruling": "upheld",
      "evidence": "tsconfig.json includes src/**/*.ts, and the cited omitted suites still import JsonSnippet or construct the removed json discriminant; repository search also finds additional omitted JSON-dependent suites."
    },
    {
      "where": "## Phase 2: Remove JSON snippet code support and rewrite README",
      "ruling": "upheld",
      "evidence": "src/snippets/snippet-service.ts:327 appends every descendant file, and src/views/snippet-tree-picker.ts:491-515 filters only by basename before rendering file rows."
    },
    {
      "where": "## Risk Flags — c2-r2",
      "ruling": "upheld",
      "evidence": "src/snippets/snippet-service.ts:365 exposes renameSnippet by path, src/__tests__/snippet-service-move.test.ts:159-169 passes a .json source, and manager callers forward node paths directly."
    },
    {
      "where": "## Risk Flags — c5-r1",
      "ruling": "upheld",
      "evidence": "src/styles/snippet-tree-picker.css:232-247 currently scopes fixed child heights; the plan raises them to 480px and 440px while adding only a max-height to the modal, with no shrinking rule for either child."
    },
    {
      "where": "## Risk Flags — c5-r2",
      "ruling": "upheld",
      "evidence": "src/styles/snippet-tree-picker.css:153-170 gives rows a 1px transparent border and border-box sizing; replacing only border-left with 2px consumes one additional pixel inside the row."
    },
    {
      "where": "c2-r1",
      "ruling": "upheld",
      "evidence": "src/__tests__/views/inline-runner-modal.test.ts:101-196 covers JSON execution paths, and the artifact explicitly chooses no migration or notice while routing legacy references to not-found."
    },
    {
      "where": "c2-r2",
      "ruling": "upheld",
      "evidence": "src/__tests__/snippet-service-move.test.ts:159-169 proves renameSnippet accepts reachable .json paths, so changing only the destination extension can relabel JSON bytes as Markdown."
    },
    {
      "where": "c5-r1",
      "ruling": "upheld",
      "evidence": "The Phase 5 declarations fix descendants at 480px and 440px but provide no media query, min-height override, flex shrink contract, or modal overflow rule for short viewports."
    },
    {
      "where": "c5-r2",
      "ruling": "upheld",
      "evidence": "The current 1px border-box row geometry at src/styles/snippet-tree-picker.css:153-170 is changed to 2px only on the highlighted left edge, producing a 1px inward content shift."
    }
  ],
  "feedback": "Update Phase 2 to cover every JSON-dependent suite, filter descendant search to supported files, reject or safely handle legacy rename sources, and define migration/not-found UX. Replace Phase 3's soft deprecation with goal-required Text block removal while preserving and testing existing Answer pass-through. Make Phase 5 child heights responsive and keep highlight border geometry constant."
}

